We talk through everything to expect at Apple's upcoming "<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/16/apple-announces-special-event-in-new-york/">Experience</a>" on March 4, on this week's episode of <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/whats-coming-at-the-march-4th-apple-experience/id1602394741?i=1000750673857">The MacRumors Show</a>.<br/>
<br/>
